Error [E1402]: compiler-extension failed: compiler-extension `incompatible.wasm` has no exported `analyze` (world `compiler-extension-v1` requires it; this is not an application `jetplugin` target)
 Why: the configured compiler-extension component could not complete analyze, or returned an invalid response (D-DX5-HOOK1)
 Fix: fix the component, or unset JET_COMPILER_EXTENSION to skip the extension
